        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  SECTION 17 — REAL RESULTS (stacked stat rows)  (self-contained Custom Liquid)\n  IMPORTANT: replace the placeholder figures with your REAL panel data before\n  running paid traffic (claim substantiation matters for skincare ads).\n{% endcomment %}\n<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Assistant:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .noula-results{font-family:inherit;color:#2D241D;padding:46px 0;border-top:1px solid #EAE1D2;}\n  .noula-results__wrap{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}\n  .noula-results__title{margin:0;text-align:center;font-family:\"Assistant\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.02em;}\n  .noula-results__lead{margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center;color:#6B5C4F;font-size:15px;}\n  .noula-results__list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:22px;}\n  .noula-stat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;border:1px solid #EAE1D2;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;background:#FBF8F3;}\n  .noula-stat__big{font-family:\"Assistant\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:46px;color:#D2978B;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.03em;flex-shrink:0;min-width:96px;}\n  .noula-stat__txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;}\n  .noula-stat__st{font-family:\"Assistant\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:1.22;}\n  .noula-stat__src{font-size:12px;color:#6B5C4F;}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"noula-results\">\n  <div class=\"noula-results__wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"noula-results__title\">Real results</h2>\n    <p class=\"noula-results__lead\">From an 8-week consumer panel of 120 women.</p>\n    <div class=\"noula-results__list\">\n      <div class=\"noula-stat\"><div class=\"noula-stat__big\">94%</div><div class=\"noula-stat__txt\"><div class=\"noula-stat__st\">looked more rested in the morning</div><div class=\"noula-stat__src\">Based on an 8-week consumer panel</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"noula-stat\"><div class=\"noula-stat__big\">9/10</div><div class=\"noula-stat__txt\"><div class=\"noula-stat__st\">said skin felt softer &amp; smoother</div><div class=\"noula-stat__src\">Based on an 8-week consumer panel</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"noula-stat\"><div class=\"noula-stat__big\">89%</div><div class=\"noula-stat__txt\"><div class=\"noula-stat__st\">would repurchase &amp; recommend</div><div class=\"noula-stat__src\">Based on an 8-week consumer panel</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
